WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.421
(logo whooshes)
(hinge squeaks)

00:00:01.421 --> 00:00:02.671
(uptempo music)

00:00:07.032 --> 00:00:07.948
- Oh, darn!

00:00:08.803 --> 00:00:10.040
- Do you have any crayons?

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:12.131
- [Voiceover] Oh, I'm sorry,
sweetie, we just ran out.

00:00:12.131 --> 00:00:13.027
- Ugh!

00:00:13.027 --> 00:00:14.959
- Daddy, can you play with me?

00:00:14.959 --> 00:00:17.379
- [Voiceover] Um, yeah,
in just one minute, okay?

00:00:17.379 --> 00:00:18.212
- Come on.

00:00:19.469 --> 00:00:20.621
- Can I have a chocolate milk, please?

00:00:20.621 --> 00:00:22.797
- [Voiceover] Uh, actually
let's make that a regular.

00:00:22.797 --> 00:00:23.736
(girl sighs)

00:00:23.736 --> 00:00:24.736
(boy laughs)

00:00:35.811 --> 00:00:37.144
- Wait a minute.

00:00:38.115 --> 00:00:39.957
- Mommy, the iPad's not working.

00:00:39.957 --> 00:00:41.022
- [Voiceover] Oh, you know what?

00:00:41.022 --> 00:00:42.706
You've probably had enough
screen time today, anyway.

00:00:42.706 --> 00:00:46.076
- No, Mommy, I can fix it, I swear!

00:00:46.076 --> 00:00:47.698
(adults murmur)

00:00:47.698 --> 00:00:49.106
- Can we go now?

00:00:49.106 --> 00:00:50.130
- [Voiceover] Hold on.

00:00:50.130 --> 00:00:51.404
(adults murmur)
(girl sighs)

00:00:51.404 --> 00:00:52.238
- [Voiceover] All right, Delilah,

00:00:52.238 --> 00:00:53.500
two minutes and then we're gonna go.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:54.334
- Okay.

00:00:56.313 --> 00:00:57.146
- [Voiceover] Okay, you ready?

00:00:57.146 --> 00:00:57.980
Let's go, time to go.

00:00:57.980 --> 00:00:59.918
- What, that wasn't two minutes!

00:00:59.918 --> 00:01:01.368
- How was your day?

00:01:01.368 --> 00:01:02.947
- Don't ask.

00:01:02.947 --> 00:01:04.398
(girl sighs)

00:01:04.398 --> 00:01:05.564
(straw slurps)

00:01:10.115 --> 00:01:12.367
(logo whooshes)
(hinge squeaks)

